WEBVTT

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:06.555
Expelliarmus!

00:00:08.296 --> 00:00:10.995
Harry, what did you just do?

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:12.474
You attacked a teacher!

00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:13.867
Tell me about Peter Pettigrew!

00:00:13.911 --> 00:00:15.086
He was at
school with us.

00:00:15.129 --> 00:00:16.783
We thought he
was our friend.

00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:18.350
No. Pettigrew's dead.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.525
You killed him!

00:00:19.568 --> 00:00:20.482
No, he didn't!

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:22.049
I thought so, too,

00:00:22.093 --> 00:00:23.877
until you mentioned seeing
Pettigrew on the Map!

00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:25.009
The Map was lying, then.

00:00:25.052 --> 00:00:26.532
The Map never lies!

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:28.447
Pettigrew's alive!

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:31.189
And he's right there!

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:33.365
Me? He's mental! I...

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:34.757
Not you.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.107
Your rat!

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.978
Scabbers has been
in my family for...

00:00:38.022 --> 00:00:39.458
12 years?!

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.852
A curiously long life
for a common garden rat.

00:00:41.895 --> 00:00:43.157
He's missing a toe,

00:00:43.201 --> 00:00:44.071
isn't he?

00:00:44.115 --> 00:00:45.464
RON:
So what?!

00:00:45.507 --> 00:00:47.031
All they could find
of Pettigrew was his fi...

00:00:47.074 --> 00:00:48.032
BLACK:Finger!

00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:49.294
The dirty coward cut it off

00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:50.817
so that everyone
would think he was dead.

00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:54.038
And then he transformed
into a rat.

00:00:54.081 --> 00:00:54.995
Show me.

00:00:55.039 --> 00:00:55.953
[ Ron whimpering]

00:00:55.996 --> 00:00:56.954
[ rat squeaking]

00:00:56.997 --> 00:00:58.259
HARRY:
Give him to him, Ron.

00:00:58.303 --> 00:00:59.565
What are you trying
to do to him?!

00:00:59.608 --> 00:01:00.566
RON:
Scabbers!

00:01:00.609 --> 00:01:01.741
[ squeaking]

00:01:01.784 --> 00:01:02.873
Leave him alone!

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:03.874
Get off him!

00:01:03.917 --> 00:01:05.049
What are
you doing?!

00:01:05.092 --> 00:01:05.919
Scabbers!

00:01:05.963 --> 00:01:07.921
[ grunts]

00:01:07.965 --> 00:01:09.618
[ chittering, piano note plays]

00:01:09.662 --> 00:01:10.489
[ grunts]

00:01:10.532 --> 00:01:13.100
[ chittering]

00:01:13.144 --> 00:01:14.406
[ yelling]

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:18.584
[ grunts and snorts]

00:01:20.151 --> 00:01:22.762
[ grunting]

00:01:22.805 --> 00:01:24.285
[ grunts]

00:01:24.329 --> 00:01:27.419
[ snorting]

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:29.203
Remus?

00:01:29.247 --> 00:01:31.597
Is-is this Sirius?

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.642
My old friends!

00:01:33.686 --> 00:01:35.296
[ grunts]

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.864
[ whimpers]

00:01:38.821 --> 00:01:40.649
PETTIGREW:
Harry, look at you.

00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:41.868
You look so much

00:01:41.912 --> 00:01:43.087
like your father,
like James.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.784
We were the best of
friends, he and I...

00:01:44.827 --> 00:01:46.090
How dare you speak to Harry!

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:47.439
[ guttural grunt]

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:48.527
How dare you talk

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:50.050
about James in front of him!

00:01:50.094 --> 00:01:53.097
You sold James and Lily
to Voldemort, didn't you?!

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.186
I didn't mean to!

00:01:55.229 --> 00:01:56.665
The Dark Lord--

00:01:56.709 --> 00:01:58.754
you have no idea the
weapons he possesses!

00:01:58.798 --> 00:01:59.973
Ask yourself, Sirius!

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:01.409
What would you have done?

00:02:01.453 --> 00:02:02.715
What would
you have done?

00:02:02.758 --> 00:02:04.108
I would have died!

00:02:04.151 --> 00:02:06.284
I would have died
rather than betray my friends!

00:02:06.327 --> 00:02:08.242
[ panting]

00:02:08.286 --> 00:02:09.591
[ loud gasping breath]

00:02:09.635 --> 00:02:12.116
Harry, James wouldn't
have wanted me killed!

00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:13.334
Your dad...

00:02:13.378 --> 00:02:14.553
Your dad would
have spared me!

00:02:14.596 --> 00:02:16.294
He would have
shown me mercy!

00:02:16.337 --> 00:02:17.556
[ screaming]

00:02:17.599 --> 00:02:18.731
BLACK:
You should have

00:02:18.774 --> 00:02:20.167
realized,
Peter, that if

00:02:20.211 --> 00:02:22.865
Voldemort didn't kill you,
then we would, together.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.824
No!

00:02:24.867 --> 00:02:28.871
Harry, this man is...

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:30.090
I know what he is.

00:02:30.134 --> 00:02:31.874
But we'll take him
to the castle.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:34.486
Oh, bless you, boy.

00:02:34.529 --> 00:02:35.922
Bless you!

00:02:35.966 --> 00:02:36.967
Get off!

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.055
[ whimpering, crying]

00:02:38.098 --> 00:02:40.057
I said we'd take you
to the castle.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.319
[ whimpers]

00:02:41.362 --> 00:02:43.669
After that,
the dementors can have you.

00:02:43.712 --> 00:02:46.498
[ whimpers and snorts]

00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:48.152
BLACK:
Sorry about the bite.

00:02:48.195 --> 00:02:49.240
[ grunts]

00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:51.024
I reckon that twinges a bit.

00:02:51.068 --> 00:02:53.461
RON:
A bit? A bit?!

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:55.028
You almost tore my leg off!

00:02:55.072 --> 00:02:56.508
Now, I was going
for the rat.

00:02:56.551 --> 00:03:00.120
Normally, I have a very
sweet disposition as a dog.

00:03:00.164 --> 00:03:03.428
In fact, more than once,
James suggested

00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:05.169
that I make the change
permanent.

00:03:05.212 --> 00:03:06.518
[ panting]

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:09.042
The tail I could live with,
but the fleas--

00:03:09.086 --> 00:03:11.914
they're murder.

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:16.006
[ bird calling]

00:03:16.919 --> 00:03:20.010
[ panting]

00:03:23.883 --> 00:03:26.277
Okay.

00:03:27.756 --> 00:03:29.889
[ bird calling]

00:03:29.932 --> 00:03:31.151
RON:
You better go.

00:03:31.195 --> 00:03:32.979
No. No. Don't
worry, okay?

00:03:33.023 --> 00:03:34.415
It's fine.
I'll stay.

00:03:34.459 --> 00:03:37.636
You go, I'll stay.

00:03:37.679 --> 00:03:38.854
You okay?

00:03:38.898 --> 00:03:40.595
I'm fine. Go.

00:03:41.031 --> 00:03:43.511
Ow. That looks really painful.

00:03:43.555 --> 00:03:44.599
So painful...

00:03:44.643 --> 00:03:47.907
they, uh... they
might chop it.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.648
HERMIONE:
I'm sure Madam Pomfrey

00:03:49.691 --> 00:03:51.258
will fix it
in a heartbeat.

00:03:51.302 --> 00:03:52.564
RON:
It's too late.

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.782
It's ruined.

00:03:53.826 --> 00:03:55.697
It'll have to
be chopped off.

00:03:55.741 --> 00:03:58.439
BLACK:
It's beautiful, isn't it?

00:03:58.483 --> 00:04:00.311
I'll never forget
the first time

00:04:00.354 --> 00:04:01.747
I walked through
those doors.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.098
It'll be nice
to do it again

00:04:05.142 --> 00:04:08.058
as a free man.

00:04:08.493 --> 00:04:12.453
That was a noble thing
you did back there.

00:04:12.497 --> 00:04:14.629
He doesn't deserve it.

00:04:14.673 --> 00:04:15.804
Well, I just
didn't think

00:04:15.848 --> 00:04:17.023
my dad would
have wanted

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.590
his two best friends
to become killers.

00:04:18.633 --> 00:04:23.029
Besides, dead, the
truth dies with him.

00:04:23.073 --> 00:04:24.248
Alive, you're free.

00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:25.814
PETTIGREW:
Turn me into a maggot!

00:04:25.858 --> 00:04:27.207
Dung beetle.
Flobberworm!

00:04:27.251 --> 00:04:28.295
LUPIN:
Shh!

00:04:28.339 --> 00:04:29.905
Anything but the dementors!Shh!

00:04:29.949 --> 00:04:31.603
Ron, ha-haven't I been
a good friend, a good pet?

00:04:31.646 --> 00:04:34.171
You won't let them give me
to the dementors, will you?

00:04:34.214 --> 00:04:35.259
I was your rat!Oh.

00:04:35.302 --> 00:04:36.303
Oh, sweet girl!
Clever girl!

00:04:36.347 --> 00:04:37.913
Surely you won't let them...

00:04:37.957 --> 00:04:39.089
Get away from her!

00:04:39.132 --> 00:04:40.220
Get away from her!

00:04:40.264 --> 00:04:41.439
PETTIGREW:
All right. Please, please!

00:04:41.482 --> 00:04:42.788
No! No! I'm weak.
I couldn't help it.

00:04:42.831 --> 00:04:44.268
I don't know if
you know, Harry,

00:04:44.311 --> 00:04:45.660
but when you
were born...

00:04:45.704 --> 00:04:47.053
Quiet!

00:04:47.097 --> 00:04:49.011
...James and Lily made me
your godfather.

00:04:49.055 --> 00:04:50.491
I know.

00:04:50.535 --> 00:04:52.798
And... well, I can understand
if you choose

00:04:52.841 --> 00:04:55.235
to stay with your aunt
and uncle...

00:04:55.279 --> 00:04:56.802
[ sniffs]

00:04:56.845 --> 00:04:58.151
...but if you ever wanted
a different home...

00:04:58.195 --> 00:05:00.980
What? Come and
live with you?

00:05:01.023 --> 00:05:02.155
Well, well, it was...

00:05:02.199 --> 00:05:03.983
It's-it's just a thought.

00:05:04.026 --> 00:05:06.420
I can understand
if you don't want to.

00:05:06.464 --> 00:05:08.770
HERMIONE:
Harry!

00:05:16.909 --> 00:05:20.869
[ loud heart beating]

00:05:22.654 --> 00:05:23.829
BLACK:
Remus, my old friend,

00:05:23.872 --> 00:05:25.744
have you taken your potion
tonight?

00:05:25.787 --> 00:05:27.137
[ pained groaning]

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.094
You know

00:05:28.138 --> 00:05:29.226
the man you truly are, Remus!

00:05:29.269 --> 00:05:31.489
This heart is
where you truly live!

00:05:31.532 --> 00:05:32.838
This heart, here!

00:05:32.881 --> 00:05:34.535
[ agonized groaning]

00:05:34.579 --> 00:05:36.929
[ whimpering groan]This flesh is only flesh!

00:05:36.972 --> 00:05:37.973
[ grunts]

00:05:38.017 --> 00:05:38.757
Expelliarmus!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.062
[ grunts]

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:42.282
[ pained grunting]

00:05:46.895 --> 00:05:49.507
[ squeaking]

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:50.899
[ Lupin yelling]

00:05:50.943 --> 00:05:52.118
Harry!

00:05:52.162 --> 00:05:54.860
Remus!

00:05:54.903 --> 00:05:55.861
Remus!

00:05:55.904 --> 00:05:59.430
[ yelling]

00:06:00.909 --> 00:06:02.172
Ooh!

00:06:02.215 --> 00:06:03.521
Run!

00:06:03.564 --> 00:06:04.391
Run!

00:06:04.435 --> 00:06:08.221
[ growling roar]

00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:11.746
[ low groaning]

00:06:13.052 --> 00:06:14.184
[ whimpering]

00:06:14.227 --> 00:06:15.359
HARRY:Come on.

00:06:15.402 --> 00:06:16.664
Wait! Wait!

00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:17.796
Hermione!

00:06:17.839 --> 00:06:19.276
[ whimpering]

00:06:19.319 --> 00:06:21.626
[ whispering]:
Bad idea, bad idea, bad...

00:06:21.669 --> 00:06:22.496
Professor?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.021
[ whining]

00:06:27.327 --> 00:06:29.634
Professor Lupin?

00:06:29.677 --> 00:06:30.809
[ whines]

00:06:30.852 --> 00:06:31.897
[ howls]

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:32.724
[ gasps]

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:34.813
[ howling]

00:06:37.076 --> 00:06:39.948
Nice doggie,
nice doggie.

00:06:40.949 --> 00:06:42.516
There you are, Potter!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.257
[ growling]

00:06:45.127 --> 00:06:46.912
[ growls]

00:06:47.521 --> 00:06:48.566
[ screams]

00:06:48.609 --> 00:06:50.307
[ growling]

00:06:50.611 --> 00:06:55.181
[ growling, barking]

00:06:55.225 --> 00:06:57.966
[ whimpering bark]

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.882
[ growling]

00:07:04.321 --> 00:07:06.410
[ snarling growls]

00:07:10.979 --> 00:07:13.765
[ whimpering]

00:07:13.808 --> 00:07:15.027
[ growls]

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:17.290
[ barks]

00:07:17.334 --> 00:07:18.335
Sirius!

00:07:18.378 --> 00:07:21.033
Come back
here, Potter!

00:07:21.076 --> 00:07:23.688
[ distant barking
and snarling]

00:07:23.731 --> 00:07:26.168
[ whimpers]

00:07:26.212 --> 00:07:27.996
[ panting whines]

00:07:31.173 --> 00:07:32.131
[ grunts]

00:07:32.174 --> 00:07:33.959
[ gasps]

00:07:34.002 --> 00:07:35.743
[ roars]

00:07:38.572 --> 00:07:40.313
[ growling]

00:07:40.357 --> 00:07:41.880
[ distant howl]

00:07:41.923 --> 00:07:43.621
[ low whine]

00:07:43.664 --> 00:07:46.145
[ growling]

00:07:46.188 --> 00:07:47.233
[ distant howl]

00:07:47.277 --> 00:07:49.148
[ panting]

00:07:49.191 --> 00:07:50.715
[ whines]

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.677
[ panting whines]

00:07:56.721 --> 00:08:00.333
[ distressed yelps]

00:08:06.339 --> 00:08:10.038
[ panting]

00:08:27.665 --> 00:08:29.362
Sirius!

00:08:29.406 --> 00:08:31.190
No!

00:08:31.233 --> 00:08:32.452
Sirius!

00:08:32.496 --> 00:08:33.714
[ pants]

00:08:33.758 --> 00:08:36.282
[ chittering]

00:08:42.854 --> 00:08:46.205
[ echoing thuds]

00:08:51.428 --> 00:08:53.734
[ gasping]

00:08:55.214 --> 00:08:59.740
[ whooshing]

00:09:04.266 --> 00:09:08.227
[ whooshing grows louder]

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.883
[ gurgling gasps, groans]

00:09:14.668 --> 00:09:18.019
Expecto Patronum!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.588
[ panting]

00:09:25.592 --> 00:09:28.682
[ whooshing]

00:09:28.726 --> 00:09:30.597
[ panting]

00:09:31.206 --> 00:09:35.950
[ screams]

00:09:39.127 --> 00:09:42.261
[ gurgling gasps]

00:09:42.304 --> 00:09:44.829
[ panting]

00:09:46.134 --> 00:09:49.790
[ groaning]

00:09:53.228 --> 00:09:56.362
[ grunting]

00:09:56.406 --> 00:09:58.451
[ labored gasp]

00:10:03.587 --> 00:10:05.893
[ whispers]:
Sirius?

00:10:05.937 --> 00:10:09.070
[ panting]

00:10:19.733 --> 00:10:24.172
[ eerie tinkling]

00:10:29.874 --> 00:10:33.443
[ distorted screeching]

00:10:40.885 --> 00:10:43.670
[ whooshing]

00:10:45.672 --> 00:10:49.502
[ panting]

00:10:55.465 --> 00:10:57.641
[ gasping grunt]

00:10:57.684 --> 00:11:00.470
[ panting]

